  "description": "Typed model of Tekla Structures drawing and view attribute files (.vi, .gd, .md, .ad, .wd, .cud, their .more and filter files) and the files of the property dialogs of the drawing editor (.dim, .drtxt, marks, graphics, links, parts, welds, reinforcement, section and detail marks, ... 41 types). Every page, tab and control of the view and drawing properties dialogs as C# properties, complete default files, view creation tables and filters, written byte for byte like Tekla. Save the files and load them by name with GADrawing, View and the other Tekla Open API objects. No Tekla reference.",
